stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M15.5 8.5l-2 5-5 2 2-5z\"/></svg></span><h3>Audit &amp; Strategy</h3><p>We review your brand, audience and competitors to set a clear direction.</p></div><div class=\"sf-step sf-reveal\" style=\"--d:90ms\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"sf-step-no\">02</span><span class=\"sf-ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18M8 2v4M16 2v4\"/></svg></span><h3>Content Calendar</h3><p>A month of planned posts, reels and campaigns aligned to your goals.</p></div><div class=\"sf-step sf-reveal\" style=\"--d:180ms\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"sf-step-no\">03</span><span class=\"sf-ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M10 9l5 3-5 3z\"/></svg></span><h3>Publish &amp; Engage</h3><p>We publish consistently and actively engage your growing community.</p></div><div class=\"sf-step sf-reveal\" style=\"--d:270ms\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"sf-step-no\">04</span><span class=\"sf-ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><path d=\"M7 14l3-3 3 3 5-6\"/></svg></span><h3>Measure &amp; Optimise</h3><p>Monthly insights guide the next cycle so results compound over time.</p></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sf-services\">\n <div class=\"sf-sec-head sf-reveal\">\n  <span class=\"sf-eyebrow\">FAQ</span>\n  <h2 class=\"sf-h2\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n  <p>Answers to the questions Goa businesses ask us most.</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"sf-faq\"><details><summary>Which social media platforms do you manage?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\">We manage Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, LinkedIn, Google Business Profile and WhatsApp, focusing on the platforms where your customers actually spend time.</div></details><details><summary>Do you create the content or do we?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\">Our in-house team handles it end to end - strategy, photography, short-form video, reels and captions - though we love collaborating with brands that have their own assets too.</div></details><details><summary>Do you also run paid social ads?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\">Yes. Alongside organic management we plan and manage Meta (Instagram &amp; Facebook) ad campaigns designed to drive enquiries, not just reach.</div></details><details><summary>How soon will we see results?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\">Organic growth is a steady build over weeks and months; paid campaigns can drive enquiries much faster. We report clearly every month so you always see progress.</div></details></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sf-cta sf-reveal\">\n <div class=\"sf-cta-in\">\n  <h2>Ready to grow your social presence?</h2>\n  <p>Let&#x27;s turn your social channels into a real growth engine for your Goa business.</p>\n  <div class=\"sf-hero-cta\">\n   <a class=\"sf-btn sf-btn-w\" href=\"https://www.sanctify.in/contact/\">Start a Project <svg class=\"sf-arw\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n   <a class=\"sf-btn sf-btn-go\" href=\"tel:+919923352923\">Call +91 99233 52923</a>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<noscript><style>.sf-facility .sf-reveal{opacity:1 !important;transform:none !important;}</style></noscript>\n<script>\n(function(){\n function ready(fn){if(document.readyState!=='loading'){fn();}else{document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',fn);}}\n ready(function(){\n  var root=document.querySelector